    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605130/extras/fb6b0d24086223edea48d82d53579678.avif?t=1750126861\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Roland, a French World War 2 paratrooper whose plane is shot down during the Invasion of Normandy. When a sudden attack from an anachronous cavalier leaves you separated from your comrade-in-arms next to a beautiful maiden in a mysterious clock tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What starts as an effort to <strong>rescue your missing comrade</strong> quickly becomes a <strong>journey across eras of French and European history</strong> as the mystery of the maiden, Jeanne, unfolds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605130/extras/f36283cf1a35c537c4ba8f0566d1a9f8.avif?t=1750126861\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605130/extras/e819dbf9a89e6fda320e60dde5a40d6f.avif?t=1750126861\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong> many key eras of <strong>French and European history</strong>, from World War 2 to the Hundred Years' War and the rule of Charlegmange as you try to recover your brother-in-arms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605130/extras/eacb0609d21327358da8fff2de66caba.avif?t=1750126861\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who is Jeanne, the maiden that rescued you? And why is she trapped in this clock tower and the woods around it that connect to so many different eras? You must <strong>uncover the reasons and unravel these mysteries</strong> to return to your proper time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605130/extras/b8282c5669e1bdfd0af596d47be6360d.avif?t=1750126861\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The foggy woods surrounding the clock tower are trapped in eternal conflict, no matter era it occupies, and solving the mystery behind the forces keeping you and Jeanne trapped there will entail <strong>fighting your way through many griping action scenes.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605130/extras/fb6b0d24086223edea48d82d53579678.avif?t=1750126861\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Roland, a French World War 2 paratrooper whose plane is shot down during the Invasion of Normandy. When a sudden attack from an anachronous cavalier leaves you separated from your comrade-in-arms next to a beautiful maiden in a mysterious clock tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What starts as an effort to <strong>rescue your missing comrade</strong> quickly becomes a <strong>journey across eras of French and European history</strong> as the mystery of the maiden, Jeanne, unfolds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605130/extras/f36283cf1a35c537c4ba8f0566d1a9f8.avif?t=1750126861\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605130/extras/e819dbf9a89e6fda320e60dde5a40d6f.avif?t=1750126861\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong> many key eras of <strong>French and European history</strong>, from World War 2 to the Hundred Years' War and the rule of Charlegmange as you try to recover your brother-in-arms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605130/extras/eacb0609d21327358da8fff2de66caba.avif?t=1750126861\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who is Jeanne, the maiden that rescued you? And why is she trapped in this clock tower and the woods around it that connect to so many different eras? You must <strong>uncover the reasons and unravel these mysteries</strong> to return to your proper time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605130/extras/b8282c5669e1bdfd0af596d47be6360d.avif?t=1750126861\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The foggy woods surrounding the clock tower are trapped in eternal conflict, no matter era it occupies, and solving the mystery behind the forces keeping you and Jeanne trapped there will entail <strong>fighting your way through many griping action scenes.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "After being transported to a strange and distorted world shrouded by endless fog, a World War II French solider meets the fated girl trapped at the center of a history of war - Jeanne. The young soldier and Jeanne the Maiden set out on a journey of penance in this historic fantasy visual novel.",
